OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for life for beating
OL,4,Aflatmate to death
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who beat his vulnerable flatmate
OL,7,Fto death in Leeds has been sentenced to
OL,8,Flife in prison.
OL,10,FScott Silkstone, 51, subjected amputee
OL,11,FDwayne Tuohey to "extreme violence" on
OL,12,FNew Year's Day using a range of
OL,13,Fweapons, including a prosthetic leg,
OL,14,Fcrutch and a metal box, police said.
OL,16,FSilkstone, of no fixed abode, dragged
OL,17,FTuohey from his flat and repeatedly
OL,18,Fstamped on him in public before leaving
OL,19,Fhim unconscious and semi-naked near
OL,20,Fbins at Gargrave Court in Burmantofts.
OL,21,FTuohey died later in hospital from his
OL,22,Finjuries.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
