OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for life for beating
OL,4,Aflatmate to death
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt Leeds Crown Court on Monday,
OL,7,FSilkstone, who was found guilty of
OL,8,Fmurder after a trial in July, was
OL,9,Fordered to serve a minimum term of 22
OL,10,Fyears in jail.
